*> BUG1 : calcul de la moyenne de 6 notes. Résultat attendu : somme 105,0 et moyenne 17,50
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BUG1.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TAB.
   05 WS-NOTE     PIC 99V9 OCCURS 6 TIMES.
01 WS-I           PIC 9.
01 WS-SOMME       PIC 99     VALUE 0.
01 WS-MOYENNE     PIC 99     VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 15 TO WS-NOTE(1)
    MOVE 18 TO WS-NOTE(2)
    MOVE 17 TO WS-NOTE(3)
    MOVE 19 TO WS-NOTE(4)
    MOVE 16 TO WS-NOTE(5)
    MOVE 20 TO WS-NOTE(6)

    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I = 6
        ADD WS-NOTE(WS-I) TO WS-SOMME
    END-PERFORM

    COMPUTE WS-MOYENNE = WS-SOMME / 6
    DISPLAY "Somme   : " WS-SOMME
    DISPLAY "Moyenne : " WS-MOYENNE
    STOP RUN.
